              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yesterday, we were honoured to receive the Ambassador of the Maldives, Dr Farah Faizal, at the Aga Khan University Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations. The visit included discussions on the possibility of having joint projects on the history of Islam in the Maldives."
